01:34:26,060 --> 01:34:31,340
later on in the agenda there is an item to assist us in going after folks that are already

2186
01:34:31,340 --> 01:34:33,140
police officers elsewhere and interested in moving.

2187
01:34:33,140 --> 01:34:37,180
So that's probably where you see the most success in a national marketing campaign.

2188
01:34:37,180 --> 01:34:38,180
We've had some success like that.

2189
01:34:38,180 --> 01:34:43,340
We have some great officers in our force right now that came here from Chicago and places

2190
01:34:43,340 --> 01:34:46,540
