2191
01:34:46,540 --> 01:34:50,820
So we've had some success, but you're kind of talking onesies, twosies in those particular

2192
01:34:50,820 --> 01:34:51,820
cases.

2193
01:34:51,820 --> 01:34:54,380
So certainly we want to push nationally as best we can.

2194
01:34:54,380 --> 01:34:57,460
Nationally speaking, folks aren't moving across the country for that job.

2195
01:34:57,460 --> 01:35:00,260
If you want to be a police officer, there's one in every community, right?

2196
01:35:00,260 --> 01:35:01,260
So there's opportunity.

