2217
01:36:16,540 --> 01:36:19,140
So far we've not been successful and come anywhere near that number.

2218
01:36:19,140 --> 01:36:23,140
So you've seen some of our graduating classes of 8 or 10 or 12.

2219
01:36:23,140 --> 01:36:27,820
And so it's something that we've got to identify ways of getting better at bringing people

2220
01:36:27,820 --> 01:36:28,820
in.

2221
01:36:28,820 --> 01:36:31,580
Now some of that also is competitive compensation packages.

2222
01:36:31,580 --> 01:36:36,580
And so we're doing studies regionally, particularly just how we compare that.

2223
01:36:36,580 --> 01:36:39,340
And I think there's some things, the work that we need to do to assist with that.

2224
01:36:39,340 --> 01:36:42,100
And that's what I'm referring to when I say we're going to probably bring you some additional

2225
01:36:42,100 --> 01:36:46,300
