01:42:49,700 --> 01:42:50,980
Where is this going to tie in?

2328
01:42:50,980 --> 01:42:56,980
I know there's a substation up Wall Triana, but that's the one I'm familiar with.

2329
01:42:56,980 --> 01:42:59,900
Is there another one that this is possibly going to tie in?

2330
01:42:59,900 --> 01:43:00,900
I'll let Mr. Jones.

2331
01:43:00,900 --> 01:43:01,900
Thank you, Mr. Davis.

2332
01:43:01,900 --> 01:43:02,900
Yeah, good evening again.

2333
01:43:02,900 --> 01:43:08,540
Chris Jones, Chief Operating Officer, Huntsville Utilities.

2334
01:43:08,540 --> 01:43:15,220
So there is an existing 46 kV transmission line that runs along Wall Triana that connects

2335
01:43:15,220 --> 01:43:20,700
to the substation for our water treatment plant and it also goes north and eventually

2336
01:43:20,700 --> 01:43:22,540
connects to Jetport substation.

2337
01:43:22,540 --> 01:43:28,220
So we'll build a new substation tying to that transmission line and the energy will go back

2338
01:43:28,220 --> 01:43:29,220
to Jetport.

2339
01:43:29,220 --> 01:43:30,220
Okay, awesome.

2340
01:43:30,220 --> 01:43:31,220
Thank you.

2341
01:43:31,220 --> 01:43:32,220
That was it.

2342
01:43:32,220 --> 01:43:33,220
No, ma'am.

2343
01:43:33,220 --> 01:43:34,220
Just a general comment.

2344
01:43:34,220 --> 01:43:39,220
This is what I understand about this is kind of complicated.

2345
01:43:39,220 --> 01:43:47,700
You've got Huntsville Utilities, City of Huntsville, working with Madison County Commission, they

2346
01:43:47,700 --> 01:43:48,700
did their thing.

2347
01:43:48,700 --> 01:43:54,820
And in this era of what we see nationally, it's just nice that we see that local city

2348
01:43:54,820 --> 01:43:59,740
governing bodies and agencies can work together for the public good.

2349
01:43:59,740 --> 01:44:05,060
That's the only way it happens out in the West, my friend, is you've got to have collaboration.

2350
01:44:05,060 --> 01:44:07,660
And kudos and a shout out to TVA.

2351
01:44:07,660 --> 01:44:11,180
They changed their policy a few years ago.

2352
01:44:11,180 --> 01:44:16,860
So what they refer to is people like Huntsville Utilities is co-ops, cooperatives, and their

2353
01:44:16,860 --> 01:44:22,300
policy forbid or prohibited any local power generation by their cooperatives.

2354
01:44:22,300 --> 01:44:24,860
So Huntsville Utilities could not have done this project.

2355
01:44:24,860 --> 01:44:31,620
But they see how they need to be reactive and proactive and change some of their policies.

2356
01:44:31,620 --> 01:44:35,900
And certainly they want a green power mix across their entire portfolio, certainly the

2357
01:44:35,900 --> 01:44:38,060
hydro power and the nuclear power.

2358
01:44:38,060 --> 01:44:39,820
They're doing some of their own solar.

2359
01:44:39,820 --> 01:44:44,140
But to allow the cooperatives, people like Huntsville Utilities, to go do projects like

2360
01:44:44,140 --> 01:44:51,060
this, we've completed one, North Huntsville Industrial Park, in partnership with Toyota.

2361
01:44:51,060 --> 01:44:57,940
Athens Electric and TVA are working on a major project, very similar, at Mazda Toyota in partnership

2362
01:44:57,940 --> 01:44:58,940
with them.

2363
01:44:58,940 --> 01:45:03,940
So one, I think it's great for our community, show diversity in how we generate power, but

2364
01:45:03,940 --> 01:45:07,900
also the resiliency that we'll bring to our community.

