It's actually created by their business partner who operate, so it's the same company, so

2369
01:45:23,220 --> 01:45:28,060
that Huntsville Utilities did an RFP, so a very competitive process.

2370
01:45:28,060 --> 01:45:31,140
So it's actually Eurus Inc.

2371
01:45:31,140 --> 01:45:35,340
They are actually a parent company of Toyota, or they were birthed out of there.

2372
01:45:35,340 --> 01:45:40,100
