2537
01:55:25,780 --> 01:55:33,100
I'm here to introduce a civic partnership vision called the Luminary, Alabama History Museum.

2538
01:55:33,100 --> 01:55:38,700
Alabama has an incredible historical assets, but no single institution tells our full multicultural

2539
01:55:38,700 --> 01:55:44,180
story from indigenous Alabama to the Civil Rights era, the space race, and the innovation

2540
01:55:44,180 --> 01:55:46,580
economy shaping our future.

2541
01:55:46,580 --> 01:55:50,500
Huntsville is the only city positioned to house that complete story.

2542
01:55:50,500 --> 01:55:53,060
The Luminary fills that statewide gap.

2543
01:55:53,060 --> 01:55:58,420
It's designed as a world class architectural iconic museum that aligns Huntsville's growth,

2544
01:55:58,420 --> 01:56:04,020
its tourism strength, and its identity as the rocket city.

2545
01:56:04,020 --> 01:56:08,340
I have two visual renderings that I want to present to the Council as well.

2546
01:56:08,340 --> 01:56:13,300
