2548
01:56:15,520 --> 01:56:17,940
Thank you.

2549
01:56:17,940 --> 01:56:23,140
The museum's four level design ascends from Alabama's foundation to its future, echoing

2550
01:56:23,140 --> 01:56:25,820
Huntsville's spirit of launching bold ideas.

2551
01:56:25,820 --> 01:56:30,780
It also includes a K through 12 educational model aligned with Alabama standards and parental

2552
01:56:30,780 --> 01:56:35,140
