2553
01:56:35,140 --> 01:56:38,040
The Luminary is not asking for funding.

2554
01:56:38,040 --> 01:56:43,860
We are seeking a partnership pathway, a concept endorsement, a designated city liaison, and

2555
01:56:43,860 --> 01:56:50,940
