2595
01:59:06,700 --> 01:59:08,140
But did I get an order?

2596
01:59:08,140 --> 01:59:09,140
But I didn't ever get an order.

2597
01:59:09,140 --> 01:59:10,140
I never got nothing.

2598
01:59:10,140 --> 01:59:12,540
And here's what the judge says about it.

2599
01:59:12,540 --> 01:59:19,100
On September 1, Janet Hampton filed a 14-day notice to vacate.

2600
01:59:19,100 --> 01:59:22,820
It was posted by law enforcement on February 25th, 2026.

2601
01:59:22,820 --> 01:59:26,700
The answer was adjudicated of this case.

2602
01:59:26,700 --> 01:59:33,100
Janet Hampton appears to have reclaimed the property, the supposed Mark Culberson's personal

2603
01:59:33,100 --> 01:59:37,060
property without agreement or notice to them.

2604
01:59:37,060 --> 01:59:43,180
After review, the statute court finds that the cause is not properly before this court

2605
01:59:43,180 --> 01:59:50,820
that under the Alabama Code section applies to this incident.

2606
01:59:50,820 --> 01:59:53,620
In other words, she's not my landlord.

2607
01:59:53,620 --> 01:59:56,500
She didn't have no right to go in my house and throw my stuff out.

2608
01:59:56,500 --> 02:00:00,060
So the police aided her in this.

2609
